<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes to stuff prey down their cleavage. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to fissure prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢将猎物塞进乳沟在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会尝试或总是尝试裂解猎物。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory type pref. (cleavage)-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage.label>捕食动物 (乳沟)</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. That's not supposed to be a hole.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]反感破裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。那不应该是个洞。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-averse pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.label>厌恶裂隙的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] likes fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. Cleavage doesn't need to stretch as far beyond the norm, unlike other methods.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.description>[PAWN_label]喜欢碎裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。乳沟不像其他方法，不需要伸展得太远而超出常规。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Fissurist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.label>Fissurist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about fissuring prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎用这种或那种方式切割猎物。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-ambivalent pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.label>裂隙-矛盾 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey, to the exclusion of other types. No other type of vore makes it so easy to make out with prey on the way down.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.description>[PAWN_label]喜爱碎裂[PAWN_possessive]捕食的动物，拒绝其他类型的动物。没有其他类型的吃人这样在怀孕的时候就很容易和猎物亲昵了。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Ravenous fissurist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.label>贪婪的 fissurist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. It doesn't even deserve to be called vore.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶破裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。它甚至不值得被召唤吃人</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-abhorring pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.label>厌恶裂隙的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes to engulf prey through their permeable outer membrane. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to engulf prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢通过可渗透的外膜吞噬猎物。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试吞噬猎物。</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory type pref. (membrane)-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane.label>捕食动物 (膜)</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane.label>
