  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶吞噬猎物[PAWN_possessive]可渗透的外膜。这是一个让你的血浆里有污物和污垢的好方法。</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Dermal-averse pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.label>厌恶皮肤的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] likes engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane, like a slime. Glomp!-->
