  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about engulfing prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎吞噬猎物的方式。</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Dermal-ambivalent pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.label>皮肤冲突 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane, like a slime. It's fun to walk around with prey like you've got a skeleton.-->
