  <!--EN: Ravenous dermacist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Obsessed.label>贪婪的 dermacist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane. Who would ever want to be restricted to a stiff, unyielding skeleton?-->
